   00498| /**
   00499|  * The research comparison procedure of data/seed/research-table-procedure.lino:
   00500|  * the prior-answer statuses and their markers (a status without markers is the
   00501|  * fallback), the localized table text, the criterion columns with their labels
   00502|  * and cell instructions, and the whole-prompt result follow-ups. Mirrors
   00503|  * parse_research_table_procedure in rust/src/solver_handlers/research_table.rs.
